#. y1:english="Here. {PA:10}This is what you wanted, right?{PA:20}||Give this to Xin Mei.\nYou received a \"{CC:ffc8c8}Fake Passport{CR:00}\".\nKazuma-san, {PA:10}I've heard a lot about you.{PA:20}||...I also heard {PA:10}Fuma-san got shot.\nWhat?\nI'm not sure if this is related to||what's been happening lately...\nBut, Fuma-san came here with a request{PA:10}||about 5 years ago.\nWhat do you mean?\nHe came to ask me to create a fake identity.\n...Birth certificate, resident||registration, {PA:10}Diploma, {PA:10}driver's license,{PA:10}\nmedical history, {PA:10}passport...\nI hacked into the city hall's database and\ncreated a completely new identity.{PA:10}\n{PA:20}What?!\nThat's all I can tell you.{PA:20}||If you would now {PA:10}excuse me...\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0081.BIN:22_0_14
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0081.BIN::line:22_0_14"
msgid "Eso es todo lo que te puedo decir.{PA:20}||Si me disculpas,{PA:10} por favor..."
msgstr ""

